physicalRef: telecom_links
description: "Telecom Link Analysis showcase - ONE MSISDN-to-MSISDN link Dataset built by the telecom_links Job from voice_cdr, sms_cdr, hlr_eir, crm_kyc, recharge and provisioning. link_kind is one of voice, sms, forwarding, shared_device, shared_identity, sim_history, shared_payment; via names the shared key (imei:, id_doc:, address:, voucher:, agent:, card:, subscriber:) or the forwarding evidence (cdr, hlr). Planted rings: docs/superpower/la-telecom-demo-data.md. Synthetic."
